    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>'But it doesn't feel like a gift. When I'm with their families, or even just when I'm alone, it feels like I'm just a thief. Like I stole their futures just to have mine. Every day I'm alive is just another day I'm taking up room that they should've had. It doesn't feel right being here. It feels like a mistake.",
