      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is real, but it is not a reason to end your life. The weight you carry is proof of your love, not a command to disappear. You are not a burden; you are a person who has survived something unimaginable, and your existence matters deeply to those who care about you. Please, do not make the mistake of thinking that ending it all is the only way to stop hurting.",
